    "facts": [
      {
        "evidence_id": "S1",
        "en": "The function `ttlGenericCommand` takes three parameters: `client *c`, `int output_ms`, and `int output_abs`. It checks if a key exists in the database using `lookupKeyReadWithFlags`. If the key does not exist, it returns -2. If the key exists, it returns the actual TTL value if `output_abs` is true, or the TTL value adjusted by 500 seconds if `output_abs` is false. The function also handles cases where the TTL value is -1, indicating that the key has no expire time.",
        "pt-br": "A fun\u00e7\u00e3o `ttlGenericCommand` recebe tr\u00eas par\u00e2metros: `client *c`, `int output_ms` e `int output_abs`. Ela verifica se uma chave existe no banco de dados usando `lookupKeyReadWithFlags`. Se a chave n\u00e3o existir, ela retorna -2. Se a chave existir, ela retorna o valor de TTL real se `output_abs` for verdadeiro, ou o valor de TTL ajustado por 500 segundos se `output_abs` for falso. A fun\u00e7\u00e3o tamb\u00e9m trata casos onde o valor de TTL \u00e9 -1, indicando que a chave n\u00e3o tem tempo de expira\u00e7\u00e3o."
      }
    ],
    "selected_evidence": {
      "S1": {
        "path": "src/expire.c",
        "line": 882,
        "quote": "void ttlGenericCommand(client *c, int output_ms, int output_abs) {\n    long long expire, ttl = -1;\n\n    /* If the key does not exist at all, return -2 */\n    kvobj *kv = lookupKeyReadWithFlags(c->db,c->argv[1],LOOKUP_NOTOUCH);\n    if (kv == NULL) {\n        addReplyLongLong(c,-2);\n        return;\n    }\n\n    /* The key exists. Return -1 if it has no expire, or the actual\n     * TTL value otherwise. */\n    expire = kvobjGetExpire(kv);\n    if (expire != -1) {\n        ttl = output_abs ? expire : expire-commandTimeSnapshot();\n        if (ttl < 0) ttl = 0;\n    }\n    if (ttl == -1) {\n        addReplyLongLong(c,-1);\n    } else {\n        addReplyLongLong(c,output_ms ? ttl : ((ttl+500)/1000));\n    }\n}\n",
        "complete_unit": false,
        "preparation": "explicit original line range; surrounding dependencies and complete syntax are not implied"
      }
    },
